{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42810","headline":"旭川祁宰思家而卒因述意呈秦川知己 · 刘兼","name":"旭川祁宰思家而卒因述意呈秦川知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁稔民康绝讼论，政成公暇自由身。\n朝看五马闲如社，夜拥双姬煖似春。\n家计不忧凭冢子，官资无愧是朝臣。\n岂同龌龊祁员外，至死悲凉一妇人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}